reasoning_trace:
The protagonist (John Carter) rescues a Zodangan noble’s cousin by defeating three attacking green warriors; this exploit earns him a commission as a padwar (lieutenant).
The rescue that earned John Carter his lieutenant’s commission occurred when he saw three green warriors attacking a red Zodangan officer. Carter: 
1) rammed and killed the first warrior with his flier;
2) engaged and killed the second warrior on foot;
3) leaped to save the Zodangan and killed the third warrior.
Thus, he personally defeated three foes, and this exploit led the Jeddak of Zodanga to commission him as a lieutenant (padwar).
